# "Testing: Board — Gifts Ungiven" (room/testing-rooms.ts): seat 0 (human) at
# its own Main Phase 1 on turn 1 with four untapped Islands and two Gifts
# Ungiven in hand, so the whole spell can be cast and seen twice. The library
# holds 18 different names (plus a second Counterspell and Brainstorm, which
# the search's "different names" rule greys once one copy is chosen), so the
# one search has real choices (search-rules.jvm.test.ts). MAIN1 rather than a later step for the same
# reason `tr-combat.state` gives. Seat 1 holds its own Gifts Ungiven and four
# Islands, and nothing that could counter seat 0's.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Gifts Ungiven;Gifts Ungiven;Island
humanbattlefield=Island;Island;Island;Island
humanlibrary=Unburial Rites;Mulldrifter;Griselbrand;Reanimate;Animate Dead;Sun Titan;Deep Analysis;Think Twice;Counterspell;Counterspell;Brainstorm;Brainstorm;Ponder;Mana Leak;Fact or Fiction;Frantic Search;Accumulated Knowledge;Careful Study;Entomb;Exhume;Snapcaster Mage;Island;Island;Swamp
